---
/** Source-matched Typography section from template-pages/licenses.html. */
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Licenses" description="Archipro design asset and font licensing notes.">
  <section class="px-6 pb-24 pt-32 sm:pt-40">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[860px]">
      <h1 class="mb-5 text-5xl font-medium tracking-tightest text-neutral-800 sm:text-6xl">Licenses</h1>
      <p class="mb-8 text-base leading-[1.6] text-neutral-600">
        All graphical assets in this template are licensed for personal and commercial use.
        If you'd like to use a specific asset, please check the license below.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-10 text-base leading-[1.6] text-neutral-600">
        Icons and other Graphics were manually designed by the BRIX Templates team. You may
        download these and edit them to fit your website without asking for permission or providing credit.
        Upon purchasing Archipro, the team grants a nonexclusive license for the included icons.
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-brand-secondary-200 p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-3xl font-medium tracking-tightest text-neutral-800">Typography</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-base leading-[1.6] text-neutral-600">
          The font family used in Archipro is Inter Tight, an open-source font from Google Fonts.
          You can download and view the font license on the original font's website.
        </p>
        <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter+Tight" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-neutral-800 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-100">Download typography</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
